  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Colloid preparation by Hydrolysis reaction: (no change in oxidation number.)</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>FeCl</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi>Fe</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>OH</mi><msub><mo>)</mo><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>(</mo><mi>sol</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>HCl</mi></math></p><p>Gold sol is prepared by reduction reaction:</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>AuCl</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>HCHO</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>Au</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>sol</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>HCOOH</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>HCl</mi></math></p><p>Preparation of sulphur sol:(oxidation)</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>SO</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>sol</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></math></p><p>Preparation of colloid by double decomposition reaction:</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>As</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><msub><mi>As</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi></mrow><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>(</mo><mi>sol</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></math></p>"
  }
